license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/somphol/khan-trig-unit3-non-right-triangles-studio"
url: "https://somphol.github.io/khan-trig-unit3-non-right-triangles-studio/"
abstract: >-
  A dependency-free, bilingual (English and Thai) interactive companion for
  Khan Academy Trigonometry Unit 3. Three canvas studios cover the Law of Sines
  and the ambiguous SSA case, a Law of Cosines SAS/SSS solver with live
  algebraic substitution, and surveying or navigation practice with animated
  map solutions, streaks and badges. The site runs entirely in the browser and
  stores progress locally.
keywords:
  - trigonometry
  - law of sines
  - law of cosines
  - ambiguous case
  - SSA
  - surveying
  - triangulation
  - mathematics education
  - interactive learning
  - bilingual education
  - Thai
  - HTML5 Canvas
